Wind profiles u(z), v(z) interpolated from ECMWF operational forecast (91 levels)
PBLH computed via bulk Ri number, ECMWF IFS eqn 3.90 (Vogelezang & Holtslag 1996), using virtual dry static energy s_v = cp*Tv + g*hbl
Code: get_richardson_number_layers_v2.m

